  "id": "end-of-summer-vegetable-curry",
  "name": "End-of-Summer Vegetable Curry",
  "subtitle": "A gently spiced curry with mixed seasonal vegetables and yogurt",
  "description": "Toast whole spices, build an aromatic onion base, simmer the vegetables until tender, then finish with yogurt and fresh herbs.",
